the entire time in secret,

00:03:42.522 --> 00:03:44.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
that made it a very
kind of different story.

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:46.025 size:84% position:42% line:92%
It became a story about

00:03:46.025 --> 00:03:49.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
how big money can silence
critical voices.

